 Be clear about this before you plan on it:
 
-- **No tank capacity, and no reserve check.** NavAid will not tell you the route exceeds your endurance. Compare the total against your own aircraft's usable fuel and your reserve minimum yourself.
+- **The burn, not the check.** This calculator shows fuel burn only. The go/no-go check — Trip + Reserve + Alternate against your usable fuel, with an over-tank warning — lives in the nav log's [Fuel check](Flight-Plan#fuel-check); set usable fuel and **Reserve (min)** on the aircraft to drive it.
